+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project has adopted CalVer (Calendar Versioning) as its version numbering scheme, tying version numbers to release calendar dates rather than arbitrary increments, in order to give automatic visibility into when releases occurred and clearer release timelines for users and operators.
